---
source: crates/tds_cli/tests/ui.rs
description: "fn keep(name: take String):\n    print(name)\n\nfn relay(name: String):\n    keep(take name)\n\nfn main():\n    relay(\"x\")\n"
---
error[TDS0409]: can't move `name`: it's only borrowed
  ┌─ TDS0409-move-out-of-borrow.tds:5:15
  │
4 │ fn relay(name: String):
  │          ---- `name` is a read parameter, so the caller still owns it
5 │     keep(take name)
  │               ^^^^ can't be moved
  │
  = help: move a copy instead: `take name.clone()`
  = help: or declare the parameter as `name: take String` to receive ownership
